cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this code, please cite it as below. It reproduces experiments from the paper by
  Camacho-Collados and Pilehvar (2018), so please cite that paper as well; it is the first entry
  under "references".
type: software
title: "preproc-imdb: reproducible IMDb experiments for 'On the Role of Text Preprocessing in Neural Network Architectures'"
abstract: >-
  An unofficial, reproducible re-implementation of the IMDb sentiment experiments in
  Camacho-Collados and Pilehvar (2018). It trains the paper's CNN and CNN+LSTM classifiers in Keras on
  four preprocessing variants of the IMDb reviews (vanilla, lowercased, lemmatized, multiword), with
  optional pre-trained UMBC word2vec embeddings, pinned dependencies, seeded runs and checksummed
  downloads of the authors' data.
authors:
